1
00:00:00,344 --> 00:00:02,144
(Amy(on Skype):)Hi.

2
00:00:02,146 --> 00:00:03,976
(Penny:)Hey, how'd it go?
Oh, great.

3
00:00:03,981 --> 00:00:06,151
(Leonard:)Dr. Gallo is terrific.

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:07,520
(Sheldon:)You know,
I-I've always been insecure

5
00:00:07,518 --> 00:00:09,418
(Leonard:)that no one cares
about what I have to say,

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,620
(Leonard:)but she made me see...

7
00:00:10,621 --> 00:00:13,391
(Penny:)Yeah, no one cares.
Did you help me out or not?

8
00:00:13,391 --> 00:00:15,491
Okay, n-now,
what I'm hearing

9
00:00:15,493 --> 00:00:17,663
(Leonard:)is that you feel that
I sometimes take too long

10
00:00:17,662 --> 00:00:18,992
(Leonard:)to express myself,

11
00:00:18,996 --> 00:00:20,766
(Leonard:)and you wish
I'd be more succinct.

12
00:00:20,765 --> 00:00:21,795
(Penny:)You're only hearing that because

13
00:00:21,799 --> 00:00:24,029
(Penny:)I cannot roll my eyes
any louder.

14
00:00:24,035 --> 00:00:27,105
(Leonard:)All right, well, after we talked
about my issues with my mother...

15
00:00:27,104 --> 00:00:29,834
(Leonard:)nothing too deep,
just how she ruined my life...

16
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,210
(Leonard:)I told her about you

17
00:00:31,209 --> 00:00:33,439
and your drug; she said
she'd be happy to meet you.

18
00:00:33,444 --> 00:00:34,544
(Leonard:)Really?

19
00:00:34,545 --> 00:00:37,215
(Penny:)Oh, you're the best
husband ever!

20
00:00:37,215 --> 00:00:41,215
(Leonard:)So you'll go to the Doctor Who
convention with me next week?

21
00:00:41,219 --> 00:00:42,789
(Sheldon:)I guess.

22
00:00:42,787 --> 00:00:46,887
(Leonard:)Oh, I actually did hear
your eyes roll that time.

23
00:00:48,092 --> 00:00:50,362
(vacuum whirring)

24
00:00:50,361 --> 00:00:52,731
(Bernadette:)Boy, when was the last time
Stuart cleaned this place?

25
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:54,100
(Howard:)No kidding.

26
00:00:54,098 --> 00:00:55,928
(Bernadette:)Oh, okay,
I'm about to suck something up.

27
00:00:55,933 --> 00:00:58,033
(Howard:)What do you think
this object sounds like?

